      "content": "okay i've got them here. look at these three: \n\n- May 12th, 3:15 AM - Oak Street (Block 400)\n- May 14th, 2:45 AM - Oak Street (Block 400)\n- May 15th, 3:30 AM - Oak Street (Block 400)\n\nit's always in the middle of the night when no one is outside, and it's the exact same stretch of road. if they were just fixing leaks, wouldn't they do it during the day when the crews can actually see what they're doing? it feels way too calculated. does that look like a normal pattern to you for routine maintenance?",
